n Ou yo kanpe nèt;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Sentete byen bèl lakay Ou a","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"O SENYÈ, jis pou tout tan.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/hat_bsa/PSA/93.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/hat_bsa/PSA/94.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/hat_bsa/PSA/92.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}